<title>JAPAN: CS First Boston to quit Jpn precious metal dealing.</title>
<headline>CS First Boston to quit Jpn precious metal dealing.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston Bullion Japan will stop precious metal dealing in Japan shortly, as a part of the Credit Suisse group's global restructuring, a senior group official said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
